  "scope": "The 2009 exterior of the historic Fatima Masumeh Shrine core in Qom. Includes the gilded mausoleum dome and drum, the Golden Iwan and north Atiq court, the Mirror Iwan and Atabaki court, their minarets, and connected exterior arcades. The separately mapped Azam Mosque, outer modern halls, and interiors are outside this model.",
